{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.DilogPartBAEAssembly","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.DilogPartBAEAssembly","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.DilogPartBBoundarySeed","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecificLimits.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.PSeries"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_boundary_majorant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_boundary_majorant","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBAEAssembly.lean#L95-L115","doc":"**Boundary-term majorant vanishes.**  `(q_m − 1)·(−log((ε_m/4)(q_m−1))) → 0`.  Since\n`ε_m = (q_m−1)²`, the argument is `(q_m−1)³/4`, so with `w := q_m−1 → 0⁺`,\n`w·(−log(w³/4)) = w·log 4 − 3·(w·log w) → 0` by the `t·log t → 0` seed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.epsBC_summable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.epsBC_summable","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBAEAssembly.lean#L87-L93","doc":"`Σ_m ε_m < ∞` — the summable schedule (p-series, p = 2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.epsBC_eq_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.epsBC_eq_sq","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/DilogPartBAEAssembly.lean#L84-L85","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_qSeqBC_sub_one_nhdsGT","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tendsto_qSeqBC_sub_one_nhdsGT","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41b